{"type":"message","id":"203bb697","parentId":"7680d870","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:19:13.881Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bad83c9ed9d3475cb595a66e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.publicdomain.calstrategy;\r\n\r\nimport java.util.List;\r\nimport java.util.Set;\r\n\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.area.service.DivisionManager;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.bresson.Bresson;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.bresson.MapHelper;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.constant.ServiceNameConstant;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.diamond.AdpLogisticBizConfig;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.diamond.PredictiveLogisticBizConfig;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.publicdomain.BuyerInfo;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.publicdomain.ClientInfo;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.publicdomain.DeliveryTiming;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.publicdomain.ItemInfo;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.result.AdpResult;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.ability.estimate.bean.PublicDomainInput;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.ability.estimate.calculator.IEstimateTimeCalculator;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.ability.estimate.constant.EstimateTimeConst;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.ability.estimate.constant.EstimateTimeType;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.ability.tracer.util.AnalyzeTimingUtil;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.entity.core.prediction.PredictiveTimingDO;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.entity.core.timing.DeliveryTimingDO;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.logistics.utils.PublicDomainUtil;\r\n\r\nimport com.google.common.collect.Lists;\r\nimport com.google.common.collect.Sets;\r\nimport com.taobao.delivery.common.transfer.tracer.DeliveryServiceInfo;\r\nimport com.taobao.delivery.common.transfer.tracer.LogisticTime;\r\nimport com.taobao.delivery.common.transfer.tracer.LogisticsTimeInfo;\r\nimport com.taobao.delivery.common.transfer.tracer.ShipTiming;\r\nimport com.taobao.delivery.common.transfer.tracer.SignTiming;\r\nimport lombok.Data;\r\nimport org.apache.commons.lang3.StringUtils;\r\nimport org.joda.time.DateTime;\r\nimport org.slf4j.Logger;\r\nimport org.slf4j.LoggerFactory;\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * @Description:\r\n * @Author: 永宸\r\n * @Date: 2020-06-04\r\n */\r\n@Data\r\npublic class EstimateTimingStrategy implements TimingCalStrategy {\r\n    private final static Logger LOGGER = LoggerFactory.getLogger(EstimateTimingStrategy.class);\r\n    /**\r\n     * 预计时效计算器\r\n     */\r\n    private List<IEstimateTimeCalculator> estimateTimeCalculators;\r\n\r\n    private DivisionManager areaDivisionManager;\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    public boolean needCalc(ItemInfo itemInfo, BuyerInfo buyerInfo, ClientInfo clientInfo) {\r\n        return PublicDomainUtil.isEstimateTiming(itemInfo.getItemTags());\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    public DeliveryTiming calcTiming(ItemInfo itemInfo, List<ItemInfo> itemInfos, BuyerInfo buyerInfo,\r\n        ClientInfo clientInfo) {\r\n        DateTime queryTime = new DateTime(System.currentTimeMillis());\r\n        Set<String> lineFrom = getLineFrom();\r\n        String lineTo = getLineTo(buyerInfo);\r\n        DeliveryTiming deliveryTiming = null;\r\n        if (!AdpLogisticBizConfig.closePublicDomainEstimate) {\r\n            deliveryTiming = calcEstimateTiming(itemInfo, queryTime, lineFrom, lineTo);\r\n        }\r\n        return deliveryTiming;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    public List<DeliveryTiming> calTiming(List<ItemInfo> itemInfos, BuyerInfo buyerInfo) {\r\n        List<DeliveryTiming> deliveryTimings = Lists.newArrayList();\r\n        DateTime queryTime = new DateTime(System.currentTimeMillis());\r\n        Set<String> lineFrom = getLineFrom();\r\n        String lineTo = getLineTo(buyerInfo);\r\n        for (ItemInfo itemInfo : itemInfos) {\r\n            // 请求计算服务\r\n            DeliveryTiming deliveryTiming = null;\r\n            if (!AdpLogisticBizConfig.closePublicDomainEstimate) {\r\n                deliveryTiming = calcEstimateTiming(itemInfo, queryTime, lineFrom, lineTo);\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // 计算未果，则默认返回一个空对象 埋点依赖\r\n            if (deliveryTiming == null) {\r\n                deliveryTiming = PublicDomainUtil.buildDeliveryTiming(itemInfo.getItemId(), buyerInfo.getAreaId());\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            deliveryTimings.add(deliveryTiming);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return deliveryTimings;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private DeliveryTiming calcEstimateTiming(ItemInfo itemInfo, DateTime queryTime, Set<String> lineFrom,\r\n        String lineTo) {\r\n        try {\r\n            // 时效计算\r\n            PredictiveTimingDO predictiveTimingDO = null;\r\n            String bizType = \"\";\r\n            PublicDomainInput input = buildPublicDomainInput(itemInfo, queryTime, lineFrom, lineTo);\r\n            for (IEstimateTimeCalculator calculator : estimateTimeCalculators) {\r\n                AdpResult<PredictiveTimingDO> adpResult = calculator.publicDomainCalc(input);\r\n                if (adpResult.isSuccess() && adpResult.getModel() != null) {\r\n                    bizType = calculator.getBizCode();\r\n                    predictiveTimingDO = adpResult.getModel();\r\n                    break;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // 时效组装\r\n            return buildDeliveryTiming(predictiveTimingDO, itemInfo.getItemId(), lineTo, bizType);\r\n        } catch (Exception e) {\r\n            Bresson.newPrometheus(\"deliveryTiming_amount\", MapHelper.of(\"type\", \"calcEstimateError\")).increase();\r\n            LOGGER.error(\"publicDomain calcEstimateError, \", e);\r\n        }\r\n        return null;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private Set<String> getLineFrom() {\r\n        Set<String> lineFrom = Sets.newHashSetWithExpectedSize(1);\r\n        lineFrom.add(EstimateTimeConst.INIT_STORE);\r\n        return lineFrom;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private String getLineTo(BuyerInfo buyerInfo) {\r\n        // 对于东莞下的街道，之前buyerInfo.getAreaId()只拿到了东莞市；现在默认通过街道townId往上翻，如果翻不到区级地址，会直接返回街道\r\n        if (buyerInfo != null && buyerInfo.getTownId() != null) {\r\n            Long townId = areaDivisionManager.getAppointLevelAreaId(buyerInfo.getTownId(),\r\n                PredictiveLogisticBizConfig.publicDomainAddrLevel);\r\n            if (townId != null) {\r\n                return String.valueOf(townId);\r\n            } else {\r\n                return String.valueOf(buyerInfo.getTownId());\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        // 有些外围调用接口，不会传入townId，仍然走areaId来取网络\r\n        if (buyerInfo != null && buyerInfo.getAreaId() != null) {\r\n            Long districtId = areaDivisionManager.getAppointLevelAreaId(buyerInfo.getAreaId(),\r\n                PredictiveLogisticBizConfig.publicDomainAddrLevel);\r\n            if (districtId != null) {\r\n                return String.valueOf(districtId);\r\n            } else {\r\n                return String.valueOf(buyerInfo.getAreaId());\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        return null;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private PublicDomainInput buildPublicDomainInput(ItemInfo itemInfo, DateTime queryTime, Set<String> lineFrom,\r\n        String lineTo) {\r\n        return PublicDomainInput.builder()\r\n            .queryTime(queryTime)\r\n            .sellerId(itemInfo.getSellerId())\r\n            .itemId(itemInfo.getItemId())\r\n            .itemTags(itemInfo.getItemTags())\r\n            .lineFrom(lineFrom)\r\n            .lineTo(lineTo)\r\n            .build();\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private DeliveryTiming buildDeliveryTiming(PredictiveTimingDO predictiveTime, Long itemId, String lineTo,\r\n        String bizType) {\r\n        if (predictiveTime == null) {\r\n            return null;\r\n        }\r\n        // 设置基本信息\r\n        DeliveryTiming deliveryTiming = new DeliveryTiming();\r\n        deliveryTiming.setItemId(itemId);\r\n        deliveryTiming.setAreaId(Long.valueOf(lineTo));\r\n        DeliveryServiceInfo deliveryServiceInfo = AnalyzeTimingUtil.initDeliveryServiceInfo();\r\n        deliveryTiming.setDeliveryServiceInfo(deliveryServiceInfo);\r\n\r\n        // 设置bizType\r\n        LogisticsTimeInfo logisticsTimeInfo = deliveryServiceInfo.getLogisticsTimeInfo();\r\n        logisticsTimeInfo.setBizType(bizType);\r\n\r\n        // 设置serviceName\r\n        DeliveryTimingDO deliveryTimingDO = new DeliveryTimingDO();\r\n        deliveryTimingDO.setLimitDate(\r\n            predictiveTime.getTiming() == null ? Integer.valueOf(999) : predictiveTime.getTiming());\r\n        String serviceName = PublicDomainUtil.getSignServiceNameByDay(deliveryTimingDO, bizType);\r\n\r\n        boolean isNextDayBiz = bizType.equals(EstimateTimeType.NEXTDAY_SIGN_TIME);\r\n        boolean isTodayTomorrowArrive = StringUtils.isNotEmpty(serviceName) &&\r\n            (ServiceNameConstant.TODAY_REACH.equals(serviceName) || ServiceNameConstant.TOMORROW_REACH.equals(\r\n                serviceName));\r\n        if (isNextDayBiz && !isTodayTomorrowArrive) {\r\n            // 设置发货坑位\r\n            String shipServiceName = PublicDomainUtil.getShipServiceNameByType(predictiveTime);\r\n            LogisticTime logisticTime = logisticsTimeInfo.getLogisticTime();\r\n            ShipTiming shipTiming = new ShipTiming();\r\n            shipTiming.setServiceName(shipServiceName);\r\n            shipTiming.setPromise(StringUtils.isNotEmpty(shipServiceName));\r\n            logisticTime.setShipTiming(shipTiming);\r\n            return deliveryTiming;\r\n        } else {\r\n            // 设置到货坑位\r\n            LogisticTime logisticTime = logisticsTimeInfo.getLogisticTime();\r\n            SignTiming signTiming = new SignTiming();\r\n            signTiming.setServiceName(serviceName);\r\n            signTiming.setPromise(false);\r\n            logisticTime.setSignTiming(signTiming);\r\n            return deliveryTiming;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779967153881}}
{"type":"message","id":"5db95197","parentId":"203bb697","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:19:38.159Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户让我分析\"发货和到货的叠加逻辑\"。我已经读取了很多关键文件，现在让我继续深入理解核心的时效计算逻辑。我需要看看几个关键文件：","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"现在我来深入分析项目中**发货和到货的叠加逻辑**。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n这是一个阿里巴巴的物流配送时效计算系统（ADP - Alibaba Delivery Platform），核心职责是根据发货时效（shipTime）和运输时效（transit/lineTiming），计算出最终的到货/签收时间（arriveTime/signTime）。\n\n---\n\n## 核心模型\n\n### 关键数据结构：`PredictiveTimingDO`\n\n这是时效计算的核心数据对象，串联了发货到到货的全链路：\n\n```\nshipTime (发货时间) + transit/lineTiming (运输天数) = arriveTime (到货时间)\n```\n\n### 关键数据结构：`SignTimeDO`\n\n```java\n// 核心字段\n- arriveDateTime: 到货时间\n- waveDateTime: 截单波动时间\n- cutOffTime: 截单时间（分钟）\n- timing: 间隔天数（从下单到到货的天数）\n- lineTiming: 线路时效（运输天数）\n- shipType: 发货类型（当日发/24h发/48h发）\n- promise: 是否承诺\n```\n\n---\n\n## 叠加逻辑分析\n\n### 1. 时效计算的策略层 (`EstimateTimingStrategy`)\n\n系统有两种时效计算策略：\n- **EstimateTimingStrategy**（预计时效）：通过 `IEstimateTimeCalculator` 链式计算\n- **PromiseTimingStrategy**（承诺时效）：基于平台承诺规则\n\n核心流程：\n```\n输入(itemInfo, buyerInfo) → 选择Calculator → 计算PredictiveTimingDO → 组装DeliveryTiming\n```\n\n### 2. 发货时效解析层 (`AdpPlusShipTimeParser` / `ShipTimeAdapterUtils`)\n\n**发货时效来源**：\n- 从 adp-plus 决策结果的 `logisticsServiceInfo` 中提取\n- 从 SDP（供应链配送平台）的 `FeeDesc` 中获取\n- 识别 `PREDICT_SHIP_TIMING` 类型的服务\n\n**时间单位转换**：\n```java\n// convertOffsetToHours: 统一转换为小时\n- TimeUnit.HOURS → 直接返回\n- TimeUnit.DAYS → offset × 24\n```\n\n### 3. 到货时效计算层 (`KaolaOrderCalculator` / `EstimateTimeUtils`)\n\n**到货时间的叠加逻辑**：\n\n```\n到货时间 = 发货时间(shipTime) + 运输时效(transit/lineTiming)\n```\n\n具体体现在：\n- `SignTimeDO.timing`：从当前到到货的总间隔天数\n- `SignTimeDO.lineTiming`：纯运输线路时效\n- `SignTimeDO.arriveDateTime`：最终到货日期\n\n### 4. 前端文案渲染层 (`EstimateTimeUtils.parseText*`)\n\n叠加后的时效被渲染为用户可见的文案：\n\n```\n\"当日发\" + \"次日达\" = \"当日发，预计明日达\"\n\"当日发\" + \"当日达\" = \"当日发，预计今日达\"\n```\n\n渲染逻辑：\n1. **发货文案**：从 `consignText` 获取（如\"当日发\"）\n2. **到货文案**：根据 `timing`（间隔天数）显示\"今日达/明日达/N天达\"\n3. **截单时间**：如果 `waveDateTime` 是今天，显示具体截单时间；否则显示\"最晚支付时间\"\n\n### 5. 考拉订单的特殊叠加逻辑 (`KaolaOrderCalculator`)\n\n考拉订单有两种时效叠加模式：\n\n**模式A：承诺时效（payIfArrivalLater）**\n```java\n// 直接从承诺标签中取到货时间，不经过计算\narrivalTime = kaolaPromiseBean.getArrivalTime()\n// 设置为23:59:59\narrivalTime = arrivalTime.withHourOfDay(23).withMinuteOfHour(59)\n// VIP差异化延迟\narrivalTime = delayDays(param, arrivalTime, false)\n```\n\n**模式B：预计时效（asdp_promise）**\n```java\n// 从物流轨迹中取到货时间\narriveTime = DateTimeUtils.toFormatDateTime(dateStr)\n// 已发货状态下的VIP差异化延迟处理\narriveTime = delayDays(param, arriveTime, true)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 核心叠加公式总结\n\n| 维度 | 叠加逻辑 |\n|------|----------|\n| **时间叠加** | `到货时间 = 发货时间 + 运输时效` |\n| **天数叠加** | `timing(总间隔) = shipOffset(发货偏移) + lineTiming(运输天数)` |\n| **文案叠加** | `签收文案 = 发货文案 + 截单时间 + 到货文案` |\n| **承诺叠加** | `是否承诺 = shipPromise && transitPromise` |\n\n---\n\n## 叠加逻辑中的特殊处理\n\n### VIP差异化延迟 (`delayDays`)\n```java\n// 已发货状态(2,3,4,5)的预计时效不延迟\n// 其他状态的时效需要加 delayDays 天\nif (ifPredict && deliveryStatus.contains(orderStatus)) {\n    return arriveTime; // 已发货不延迟\n}\nreturn arriveTime.plusDays(delayDays); // 未发货延迟\n```\n\n### 发货时效类型识别\n- `SHIP_TODAY`（当日发）：发货时间 = 今天\n- `SHIP_24H`（24小时发）：发货时间 = 1天内\n- `SHIP_48H`（48小时发）：发货时间 = 2天内\n\n### 文案渲染中的叠加条件\n```\n\"发货文案\" + \"当日达/次日达/N天达\" + \"截单时间前支付\" + \"预计/承诺\" + \"日期后缀\"\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"idealab","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":62724,"output":1316,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64040,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779967153882,"responseId":"msg-c68b78b5-9260-9441-8639-174fa56b67ad"}}
