{"type":"message","id":"397e7824","parentId":"fa07b60d","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:35:06.814Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e2fd3c9ea49b4304affb400e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.service;\r\n\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.api.model.constant.TemplateType;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.api.model.request.AdpItemInfo;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.spi.model.template.CountPricingRule;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.spi.model.template.FreightTemplate;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.spi.model.template.PricingRule;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.spi.model.template.VolumePricingRule;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.core.spi.model.template.WeightPricingRule;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.template.dto.DeliveryTemplateDTO;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.template.dto.DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO;\r\nimport com.google.common.collect.Lists;\r\nimport com.google.common.collect.Range;\r\nimport org.apache.commons.collections4.CollectionUtils;\r\n\r\nimport java.util.Comparator;\r\nimport java.util.List;\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 模版构建\r\n * @author jiajun.njj 2021/6/17 10:55 上午\r\n */\r\npublic class AdpFeeTemplateBuilder {\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * 构建一个包邮的模版\r\n     * 默认是数量计价模式\r\n     */\r\n    public static FreightTemplate buildFreeTemplate(AdpItemInfo itemInfo) {\r\n        FreightTemplate freightTemplate = new FreightTemplate();\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateId(0);\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateType(TemplateType.FREE_TEMPLATE);\r\n        freightTemplate.setUserId(itemInfo.getSeller().getUserId());\r\n        PricingRule pricingRule = buildFixedCountPricingRule(0L);\r\n        freightTemplate.setPricingRules(Lists.newArrayList(pricingRule));\r\n        return freightTemplate;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * 构建一个固定运费模版\r\n     */\r\n    public static FreightTemplate buildFixedTemplate(AdpItemInfo itemInfo) {\r\n        FreightTemplate freightTemplate = new FreightTemplate();\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateId(0);\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateType(TemplateType.FIXED_PRICE_TEMPLATE);\r\n        freightTemplate.setUserId(itemInfo.getSeller().getUserId());\r\n        PricingRule pricingRule = buildFixedCountPricingRule(itemInfo.getUnifiedExpressLong());\r\n        freightTemplate.setPricingRules(Lists.newArrayList(pricingRule));\r\n        return freightTemplate;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * 根据db模版结构转换为运费模版逻辑结构\r\n     * 目前仅取-4的运送方式\r\n     * @return 计价模版逻辑结构\r\n     */\r\n    public static FreightTemplate convertTemplate(DeliveryTemplateDTO deliveryTemplate) {\r\n        List<DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO> deliveryTemplateFeeDTOS = deliveryTemplate.getTemplateFees().get(-4L);\r\n        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(deliveryTemplateFeeDTOS)) {\r\n            return null;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        FreightTemplate freightTemplate = new FreightTemplate();\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateId(deliveryTemplate.getTemplateId());\r\n        freightTemplate.setTemplateType(TemplateType.SELLER_TEMPLATE);\r\n        freightTemplate.setUserId(deliveryTemplate.getUserId());\r\n\r\n        List<PricingRule> pricingRules = Lists.newArrayList();\r\n        for (DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO deliveryTemplateFeeDTO : deliveryTemplateFeeDTOS) {\r\n            PricingRule pricingRule = buildPricingRule(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO, deliveryTemplate.getValuation());\r\n            if (pricingRule != null) {\r\n                pricingRules.add(pricingRule);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        pricingRules.sort((o1, o2) -> {\r\n            if (o1.getPriceRange().upperEndpoint() > o2.getPriceRange().upperEndpoint()) {\r\n                return 1;\r\n            }\r\n            if (o1.getPriceRange().upperEndpoint().equals(o2.getPriceRange().upperEndpoint())) {\r\n                return (int) (o1.getPriceRange().lowerEndpoint() - o2.getPriceRange().lowerEndpoint());\r\n            }\r\n            return -1;\r\n        });\r\n        freightTemplate.setToAreaId(deliveryTemplate.getAreaId());\r\n        freightTemplate.setPricingRules(pricingRules);\r\n        return freightTemplate;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    public static PricingRule buildPricingRule(DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO deliveryTemplateFeeDTO, Integer valuation) {\r\n        PricingRule pricingRule;\r\n        switch (valuation) {\r\n            case 0:\r\n                pricingRule = buildCountPricingRule(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 1:\r\n                pricingRule = buildWeightPricingRule(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO);\r\n                break;\r\n            case 3:\r\n                pricingRule = buildVolumePricingRule(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO);\r\n                break;\r\n            default:\r\n                pricingRule = buildCountPricingRule(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO);\r\n        }\r\n        return pricingRule;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private static VolumePricingRule buildVolumePricingRule(DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO deliveryTemplateFeeDTO) {\r\n        long startFeeRange = 0;\r\n        long endFeeRange = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\r\n        VolumePricingRule volumePricingRule = new VolumePricingRule();\r\n        volumePricingRule.setStartVolume(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartStandard());\r\n        volumePricingRule.setStartFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartFee());\r\n        volumePricingRule.setAddVolume(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddStandard());\r\n        volumePricingRule.setAddFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddFee());\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard() != null) {\r\n            startFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard();\r\n        }\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd() != null) {\r\n            endFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd();\r\n        }\r\n        Range<Long> closedFeeRange = Range.closedOpen(startFeeRange, endFeeRange);\r\n        volumePricingRule.setPriceRange(closedFeeRange);\r\n        return volumePricingRule;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private static WeightPricingRule buildWeightPricingRule(DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO deliveryTemplateFeeDTO) {\r\n        long startFeeRange = 0;\r\n        long endFeeRange = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\r\n        WeightPricingRule weightPricingRule = new WeightPricingRule();\r\n        weightPricingRule.setStartWeight(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartStandard());\r\n        weightPricingRule.setStartFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartFee());\r\n        weightPricingRule.setAddWeight(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddStandard());\r\n        weightPricingRule.setAddFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddFee());\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard() != null) {\r\n            startFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard();\r\n        }\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd() != null) {\r\n            endFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd();\r\n        }\r\n        Range<Long> closedFeeRange = Range.closedOpen(startFeeRange, endFeeRange);\r\n        weightPricingRule.setPriceRange(closedFeeRange);\r\n        return weightPricingRule;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private static CountPricingRule buildCountPricingRule(DeliveryTemplateFeeDTO deliveryTemplateFeeDTO) {\r\n        long startFeeRange = 0;\r\n        long endFeeRange = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\r\n        CountPricingRule countPricingRule = new CountPricingRule();\r\n        countPricingRule.setStartCount(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartStandard());\r\n        countPricingRule.setStartFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getStartFee());\r\n        countPricingRule.setAddCount(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddStandard());\r\n        countPricingRule.setAddFee(deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getAddFee());\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard() != null) {\r\n            startFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeStandard();\r\n        }\r\n        if (deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd() != null) {\r\n            endFeeRange = deliveryTemplateFeeDTO.getRegionFeeAdd();\r\n        }\r\n        Range<Long> closedFeeRange = Range.closedOpen(startFeeRange, endFeeRange);\r\n        countPricingRule.setPriceRange(closedFeeRange);\r\n        return countPricingRule;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    private static CountPricingRule buildFixedCountPricingRule(Long fixedFee) {\r\n        CountPricingRule countPricingRule = new CountPricingRule();\r\n        countPricingRule.setStartCount(0);\r\n        int startFee = 0;\r\n        if (fixedFee != null && fixedFee > 0) {\r\n            startFee = fixedFee.intValue();\r\n        }\r\n        countPricingRule.setStartFee(startFee);\r\n        countPricingRule.setAddCount(1);\r\n        countPricingRule.setAddFee(0);\r\n        Range<Long> closedFeeRange = Range.closedOpen(0L, Long.MAX_VALUE);\r\n        countPricingRule.setPriceRange(closedFeeRange);\r\n        return countPricingRule;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779968106814}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ad051e0","parentId":"397e7824","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:35:29.515Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求分析运送方式-7（DELIVERY_HOME_FC，猫象送货入户）的运费计算逻辑。\n\n从之前的分析中，我已经收集了足够的信息来理解整个运费计算流程：\n\n1. **运送方式-7定义**：`DELIVERY_HOME_FC`（猫象送货入户），定义在 `LogisticsServiceEnum.java` 中\n2. **专用运费计算器**：`FcFreightCalculator.java`，继承自 `DefaultFreightCalculator`\n3. **运费分摊**：使用 `FeeApportionUtils.apportionToItemRefine()` 按重量策略分摊\n4. **运费模板构建**：`AdpFeeTemplateBuilder` 负责将DB模板转换为逻辑模板\n5. **计价规则**：支持多种计价方式（按数量、重量、体积）\n\n现在我可以给出完整的分析报告。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"基于之前的代码分析，现在可以给出完整的**运送方式-7（DELIVERY_HOME_FC，猫象送货入户）运费计算逻辑**分析：\n\n---\n\n## 运送方式-7 运费计算逻辑\n\n### 1. 运送方式定义\n\n```java\n// LogisticsServiceEnum.java\nDELIVERY_HOME_FC(\"7\", \"猫象送货入户\", \"deliveryHome\")\n```\n\n### 2. 整体计算流程\n\n```\n请求运费 → FcFreightCalculator.canCombine() 判断是否准入\n    ↓\ncombine() - 按卖家维度合并包裹\n    ↓\ngrouping() - 分包邮品和非包邮品两组\n    ↓\ncalculate() - 按分组执行运费计算\n    ↓\napportionToItemRefine() - 按重量分摊到每个商品\n```\n\n### 3. 核心计算步骤\n\n#### 步骤1：准入判断 (`canCombine`)\n- 检查商品是否包含 `fcOfficialItemTag`（FC商品标）\n- 只有带有该标记的商品才会走FC专用运费计算器\n\n#### 步骤2：包裹合并 (`combine`)\n```\n按卖家(Seller)维度合并所有物流包裹\n同一卖家的所有订单合并为一个 LogisticsPackage\n```\n\n#### 步骤3：商品分组 (`grouping`)\n\n| 分组类型 | 包含商品 | 运费模板 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **包邮组** | 包邮品 + 赠品 | 取第一个包邮品的模板（固定运费0） |\n| **非包邮组** | 非包邮品 | 通过 `decideFreightTemplate()` 按卖家优先级选择模板 |\n\n**关键逻辑**：非包邮组的总金额 = 非包邮品金额 + 包邮品金额\n```java\nfreightGroup.setRealPrice(freightGroup.getRealPrice() + postFreePriceTotal);\n```\n\n#### 步骤4：运费计价 (`doCalculate`)\n\n```\n运费 = PricingRule.pricing(group)\n```\n\n**计价规则类型**（由运费模板的 `valuation` 字段决定）：\n\n| valuation | 计价方式 | 计算公式 |\n|-----------|----------|----------|\n| 0 | **按件数** | `startFee + ceil((count - startCount) / addCount) * addFee` |\n| 1 | **按重量** | `startFee + ceil((weight - startWeight) / addWeight) * addFee` |\n| 3 | **按体积** | `startFee + ceil((volume - startVolume) / addVolume) * addFee` |\n\n**价格区间规则**：每个计价规则有 `priceRange`（价格区间），只有当订单金额落在区间内时才适用该规则。\n\n#### 步骤5：运费分摊 (`apportionToItemRefine`)\n\n**FC专用分摊策略**：`FreightAppointStrategy.WEIGHT`（按重量分摊）\n\n```java\n// 与 DefaultFreightCalculator 的区别：\n// Default: PRICE 策略 - 按商品价格比例分摊\n// FC:      WEIGHT 策略 - 按商品重量比例分摊\n\n商品i分摊运费 = 总运费 × 商品i重量 / 所有商品总重量\n```\n\n**分摊细节**：\n- 如果总重量为0且运费>0，则全部运费加到最后一个商品上\n- 避免\"丢失最后一分钱\"的精度问题\n\n### 4. 运费模板优先级\n\nFC支持按卖家配置运费模板优先级：\n```java\n// AdpNewLogisticBizConfig.fcFreightTemplatePriority\n// 格式: sellerId1:templateId1,templateId2;sellerId2:templateId3\n```\n\n通过 `decideFreightTemplate()` 方法按优先级选择模板。\n\n### 5. 运费快照\n\n每次计算会生成 `FreightSnapshot` 记录：\n- 计算器类型：`normal`\n- 运费模板ID、版本号\n- 商品价格/重量/体积\n- 目的地编码\n- 实际运费\n\n### 6. 与其他计算器的区别\n\n| 特性 | DefaultFreightCalculator | FcFreightCalculator |\n|------|-------------------------|---------------------|\n| Order值 | 1000（优先级低） | 900（优先级高） |\n| 分摊策略 | PRICE（按价格） | WEIGHT（按重量） |\n| 包裹合并 | 无 | 按卖家合并 |\n| 分组逻辑 | 按模板分组 | 包邮/非包邮分组 |"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"idealab","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":98520,"output":1327,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99847,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779968106815,"responseId":"msg-c10813e7-d3f6-941d-b8bb-5705ed8165f9"}}
