{"type":"message","id":"f197713b","parentId":"54d50659","timestamp":"2026-05-28T11:39:14.702Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求分析 TMALL_SELLER_SETTING 的发货时效计算逻辑。我已经收集了大量信息，包括：\n\n1. 核心计算器：`TmallClothesSellerSettingShipTimingForwardCalculator`\n2. 接口：`IShipTimingForwardCalculator`\n3. 工具类：`ShipTimeUtils`（包含 `getShipTimeOfInv` 和 `validTmallClothesShipTime`）\n4. 执行器：`ShipTimeCalExecutor`\n5. 依赖服务：`ShipTimeWrapperService`, `ShipTimeSaleRuleService`, `SpringFestivalShipTimeRuleService`, `PresentShipTimeControlService`, `ChangeSkuControlService`\n\n让我整理这些信息并给出完整的分析报告。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"基于之前收集的所有信息，现在让我给出完整的分析报告。\n\n## TMALL_SELLER_SETTING 发货时效计算逻辑\n\n### 1. 核心计算器\n\n**类名**: `TmallClothesSellerSettingShipTimingForwardCalculator`\n**ShipType**: `ShipTypeEnum.TMALL_CLOTHES_SELLER_SETTING`（天猫服饰商家设置发货时效）\n\n### 2. 计算流程\n\n```\n入口: doCal()\n    │\n    ├─ 1. doCalProcess() —— 核心时效计算\n    │     ├─ getShipTimeOfInv() —— 从库存获取发货时间\n    │     │     ├─ scItem.getDeliveryTime() —— 获取主品发货时间\n    │     │     └─ 遍历子商品, getLargerShipTime() 取最大发货时间\n    │     │\n    │     └─ validTmallClothesShipTime() —— 校验发货时间是否有效\n    │           ├─ 固定时间(1_YYYY-MM-DD): 距今天数 >= tmallClothesAbsolutionBetweenDays\n    │           └─ 相对时间(2_N): N >= tmallClothesRelativeLeastDays\n    │\n    ├─ 2. PresentShipTimeControlService.doProcess() —— 赠品时效管控\n    ├─ 3. ChangeSkuControlService.doProcess() —— 换SKU时效管控  \n    ├─ 4. ShipTimeSaleRuleService.doProcess() —— 销售规则时效管控\n    ├─ 5. SpringFestivalShipTimeRuleService.process() —— 春节管控时效处理\n    │\n    └─ 6. ShipTimeWrapperService.wrapShipTimeDOSafety() —— 封装承诺信息\n          └─ 规则枚举: T_MALL_CLOTHES_SELLER_SETTING_SHIP_TIMING\n          └─ 售卖类型: PRE_SELL (预售)\n```\n\n### 3. 准入条件\n\n```java\n// 只商品标签包含 TMALL_CLOTHES 才计算\ndeliveryCarrierDO.getDeliveryCarrierDTO()\n    .getItemTags()\n    .contains(ItemTags.TMALL_CLOTHES.getTag())\n```\n\n### 4. 发货时间来源\n\n**数据源**: 库存系统 (`ScItem.getDeliveryTime()`)\n\n**格式**: \n- `1_2024-01-15` (固定时间)\n- `2_7` (相对时间，7天)\n\n**多商品逻辑**: 取最大的发货时间（最晚发货的那个）\n```java\n// 遍历子商品，取最大发货时间\nfor (ScItem childItem : scItem.getChildItems()) {\n    invShipTime = getLargerShipTime(invShipTime, childItem.getDeliveryTime());\n}\n```\n\n### 5. 校验规则\n\n| 时间类型 | 格式 | 校验规则 |\n|----------|------|----------|\n| 固定时间 | `1_YYYY-MM-DD` | 距今天数 >= `tmallClothesAbsolutionBetweenDays` (Diamond配置) |\n| 相对时间 | `2_N` | N >= `tmallClothesRelativeLeastDays` (Diamond配置) |\n\n### 6. 时效处理链路\n\n| 处理器 | 功能 |\n|--------|------|\n| `PresentShipTimeControlService` | 处理赠品相关的时效逻辑 |\n| `ChangeSkuControlService` | 处理SKU变更时的时效控制 |\n| `ShipTimeSaleRuleService` | 处理销售规则相关的时效 |\n| `SpringFestivalShipTimeRuleService` | 处理春节期间的时效调整 |\n| `ShipTimeWrapperService` | 封装承诺信息到 ShipTimeDO |\n\n### 7. 返回值\n\n```java\nShipTimeDO.builder()\n    .shipTime(shipTimeOfInv)        // 发货时间\n    .decisionReason(\"天猫服饰商家设置发货时效\")  // 决策原因\n    .shipType(ShipTypeEnum.TMALL_CLOTHES_SELLER_SETTING)  // 时效类型\n    .build()\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"idealab","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":126405,"output":1194,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":127599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779968333959,"responseId":"msg-8acfb84a-8f04-93e2-9018-c17af295dc20"}}
